  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Youth-Led Implementation and Accountability for the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to generate momentum and tangible outcomes for the role of youth in the implementation, monitoring and accountability of the SDGs to ensure that the crucial first 100 days of SDGs are set up for success. This will be done through a #Generation2030: Torchbearers for the SDGs high level event in September 2015, through contributing to a global campaign to secure commitments towards the role of youth in the SDGs, and through a launch event in New York in 2016 which will launch the findings and recommendations of Restless Developments &apos;Case for Space&apos; initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
